    {
      "name": "Member",
      "description": "Member CRUD — POST /core/dynamic-screen-wrapper/ for Create/Update.\n\nKey rules:\n- Has 1 stepper child: KYC Details (grid rows)\n- pan_no must be unique (format: ABCDE1234F)\n- mobile_no must be integer, NOT string\n- prefix_ref_id: 1895=Mrs, 1896=Mr, 1897=Ms\n- kyc_doc_id: 65=PAN, 66=AADHAR\n- party_ref_id auto-fills name, PAN, phone, shares, KYC when set\n- No Delete endpoint exists",
